 Good morning. An exciting update for y'all:

 Thomas Novelly has joined the Future of Defense crew. He'll be covering everything space. (See his first contributions below ⤵️) This newsletter will begin publishing twice a week. Exact timing TBD. 🚨 Situational awareness: Boeing won the F/A-XX competition and will build the U.S. Navy's futuristic fighter. (It's also building the Air Force's F-47.) The contract is worth more than $20 billion. More here .

 Pick and choose: Space effects, Russian calculus and double-fisting Blackbeards.

 Today's newsletter is 1,790 words, a 7-minute read. 

 
 
