 7. Check this out 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 
 A double dose of Blackbeard. Screenshot: NAVAIR/via X 

 
 
 
 &nbsp; 
 
 We knew Castelion's Blackbeard was airborne. 

 We just hadn't seen it like this. The big picture: Footage shared Sept. 25 by Naval Air Systems Command offered, as The Aviationist put it, the "clearest look yet" at the hypersonic missile.

 The War Zone, meanwhile, noted its "relatively small size." Go deeper: Startup missile maker now valued at $13 billion 

 
 
